SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ddiirrnnaammee() function conforms to X/Open Portability Guide Issue 4,
     Version 2 (“XPG4.2”).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ddiirrnnaammee() function first appeared in OpenBSD 2.2 and FreeBSD 4.2.

     In FreeBSD 12.0, this function was reimplemented to store its result in
     the provided input buffer.

